{"abstract":"DEBAT: En vej til succesfuld innovation er, at erhvervslivet inviteres helt ind på universiteterne. Relationerne er vigtige, men tager tid at udvikle, skriver styregruppen for Open Entrepreneurship.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Mommsen, Morten","Thellersen, Marianne","Broeng, Jes","Westensee, John","Stigaard, Dorte","Godskesen, Jens Christian","Steffensen, Georg Dam","Gjede, Andreas Aasted","Winterø, Trine","Kjær, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-004232"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Entrepreneurship","Innovation","Samarbejde","samarbejde mellem offentlige og private aktører"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["The Danish Industry Foundation"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"aktører samarbejde med erhvervet er nøglen til forskningsbaserede startups","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/arbejdsmarked/artikel/debat-samarbejde-med-erhvervslivet-er-noeglen-til-forskningsbaserede-startups","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-004232","ids":["aau-569d88bb-578f-40d5-a6d8-6f25d7c3330b","dtu-c33fbaa9-66d1-421f-a431-d705b9e03b7f"],"keyword":["Entrepreneurship","Samarbejde","forskningsbaserede startups","innovation","samarbejde mellem offentlige og private aktører"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-D3DAA7544F064552CB228C5B4C1367A9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/arbejdsmarked/artikel/debat-samarbejde-med-erhvervslivet-er-noeglen-til-forskningsbaser